_D_e_s_c_r_i_p_t_i_o_n:

     A dataset containing observations of pollinator visits to plants,
     recorded between 2011 and 2024.

_U_s_a_g_e:

     interaction_data
     
_F_o_r_m_a_t:

     A data frame with one row per interaction event.

     sampling_id A unique identifier for each sampling event.

     year, month, day, hour, minute Date and time of the observation.

     plot_id The numeric identifier for the research plot, linking to
          `plant_abundance`.

     plant_code The short code for the plant species, linking to
          `plant_abundance`.

     plant_name The full scientific name of the plant species.

     pollinator_id The identifier for the pollinator species.

     interaction_count The number of individuals observed in the
          interaction.

     experiment_run An identifier for the experimental run or locality.

     sex The sex of the pollinator, if recorded.

     shade A flag indicating if the observation was in the shade.


